    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Space is a dark forest&quot;</strong><br>Reveal yourself, and you will DIE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Unknown is a point-and-click indie space adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself aboard a lone spaceship, facing an unknown planet.<br>Driven by curiosity, you press a button\u2014<br>a signal is sent, and in an instant, the planet is no more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Discover. Experience the unknown.<br>Unravel the secrets of this universe,<br>and perhaps, in the shadows of the cosmos,<br>you may stumble upon a lost civilization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
